  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Frl 101.01 Purpose and Scope. The rules of this title implement the statutory responsibilities of the New Hampshire board of registration of funeral directors and embalmers created by RSA 325.\n\nSource. #1689, eff 12-22-80; rpld by #2344, eff 4-15-83; ss by #2986, eff 3-18-85; ss by #4357, eff 1-20-88, EXPIRED: 1-20-94\n\nNew. #6927, eff 1-1-99; ss by #14456, eff 1-1-26",
